source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A `\\` pair inside a span is a forced newline; jiro keeps the legacy reading of one literal backslash.
-- input.jira --
{{a\\b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
